nd session persistence."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"The limits are deliberate: Chromium only; ports are browser previews, not public services; Python ru"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ns scripts but has no general REPL; native binaries, `apt`, and real permission isolation are unavai"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"ipts but has no general REPL; native binaries, `apt`, and real permission isolation are unavailable."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## How To Use It"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### Run the standalone app"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Open `http://localhost:7892`, then enter `help`. A typical workflow is:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Use `ports` to find the preview URL, `snapshot save` to keep the workspace, and `succinix doctor` to"},{"id":"p15s2","text":" check the environment."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### Embed it in an application"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Install the dependencies and publish the engine assets as static files. Installing the npm package a"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"lone does not make those files available to the browser."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Configure the plugin, attach the WebContainer created by the application, then create the default in"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"re the plugin, attach the WebContainer created by the application, then create the default instance:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Application plugins explicitly inject `fs`, `sandbox`, `terminals`, and `sessionPersistence` as need"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ed. Use `ctx.get('succinix', false)` only when managing the host lifecycle, instances, ports, or exe"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"e `ctx.get('succinix', false)` only when managing the host lifecycle, instances, ports, or executor."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Documentation"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- Features: decide whether Succinix fits the task.\n- Runtimes: supported languages, packages, and li"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"mits.\n- Integration: embed Succinix in a Cordis application.\n- Third-party plugins: write a Cordis p"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"lugin that uses Succinix.\n- Migration: upgrade older integrations.\n- Protocol and contract: only for"},{"id":"p23s4","text":" host, transport, or strict compatibility work."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Development Checks"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"See AGENTS.md for the complete quality gates."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
